<title>UK: Banque de la Mediterranee sets $75 mln two-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Banque de la Mediterranee sets $75 mln two-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE DE LA MEDITERRANEE</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    +265-270 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 50*	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/LEB</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>		*PLUS INTEGRAL MULTIPLES OF 10 (K)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
